SUMMARY:Impromptu Aaron’s Birthday Ride (42R) + Lunch
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**Ride Leader Aaron Siebe
 rt**\n**Pace between 14-16 mph**\n**All are welcome to drive down to**\n**
 Mad Chef in East Petersburg for lunch after the ride.**\n\n**This ride is 
 a social ride\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclis
 ts may pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be supportive of the o
 ther cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back o
 f the last group. We will stop to regroup as needed.**\n\n**Ride with GPS 
 links:**\nhttps://ridewithgps.com/routes/27381189\nhttps://routes.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/route/ep-hammer-creek/\n\n**Helmets are mandatory\; please a
 lso plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\,
  tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).**\n**Being a Meetup Member does not mea
 n you are a club member. Use this link to join the club.**\n[https://www.l
 ancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.l
 ancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\n**Your RSVP 
 is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct** [https://lancbi
 keclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32
 3984](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=323984)\n**and Rules of the Road**\n[https://lancbikeclu
 b.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/cont
 ent.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=325159)
