SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- REVISED LR Mill 72 and Trolley Line Coffee (30R) -- RSV
 P required
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: volunteer to
  lead!\nRide Sweep: (volunteer to sweep!)\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotat
 ing start location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mi
 le routes\n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” sto
 p for refreshment/coffee mid-route at either [Mill 72 Bake Shop](https://m
 ill72.com/) or [Trolley Line Coffee](https://trolleylinecoffee.com/)\n\n**
 *Revised Start Location!***\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not
  have a single pace.\nAs Sweep\, Rick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyc
 list.\nThe CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expecte
 d to stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces.
  A planned stop to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the oth
 er cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of 
 the last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [
 Ride with GPS](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/57729769?via=MVXN-12lr5LXNms
 bl80ZSw)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water and a b
 asic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo elim
 inate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club membersh
 ip and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does not me
 an you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/co
 ntent.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreement to a
 bide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/
 content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules of the
  Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_i
 d=257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbikeclub.
 net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn case of accident\, consult the [Ride Leader G
 uide](https://s3.amazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents/Ride_
 Leader_Guide_2026_123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&Expire
 s=1778249903&response-content-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRide_Lead
 er_Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
